#. module: saltstack_managementsystem
msgid "Document an infrastructure deviation as a nonconformity in the management system. Use for deviations that need to be handled according to ISO processes — root cause analysis, corrective actions."
msgstr "Dokumentera en infrastrukturavvikelse som en nonconformity i ledningssystemet. Används för avvikelser som behöver hanteras enligt ISO-processer — root cause analysis, corrective actions."
